{{Quote|Maybe it's a Trodatome or something that got lost. Not that I've seen one on board, and lucky for them, since I'm not sure one would fit into an escape pod. They're kind of squidgy, though, so maybe one could smush in?|[[Pikka Adren]]|<ref name="The Fallen Star">''[[The High Republic: The Fallen Star]]''</ref>}}
The '''Trodatome''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]]. While they had no [[Limb|arms]], they possessed prehensile sensory [[antenna]]e and flippers. The Trodatome [[Klaud]] worked as a [[Technician|mechanic]] in the [[Resistance]].<ref name="TROS VD" /> At least one Trodatome, [[Gido]],<ref name="Star Wars Jedi: Survivor">''[[Star Wars Jedi: Survivor]]''</ref> was present on the [[planet]] [[Koboh]]<ref name="Twitter">{{Twitter|EAStarWars|status/1628077125302616064|[[Electronic Arts|EA Star Wars]]|date=2023-02-21|quote=Don the robes, wield the saber and holster the blaster inspired by Obi-Wan Kenobi when you pre-order #StarWarsJediSurvivor. 🔗: https://go.ea.com/m7F3N|archivedate=20230301010005}}</ref> in [[9 BBY]].<ref name="Date">{{JediSurvivorDate}}</ref>
